Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是个麻烦吗？是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I trouble? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:05.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}偶尔，你就得打破规则。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every now and then, you got to break the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.51,0:00:07.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到想要的东西，就去拿下它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see something you want, and you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，他在跟你说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, he's talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:10.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停！我刚让你亲那男的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop! I just told you to kiss the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把《女求爱者》交给麦迪逊了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You gave the Suitress to Madison?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不想碰那摊“有毒污泥”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanted no part of the "toxic sludge."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不想挡着你的“本质诚实”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I didn't want to get in the way of your "Essential Honesty."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想了解我，正式约我出去，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to get to know me and ask me out on a real date,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我会答应。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}maybe I'll say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:25.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢。这家伙是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love it. Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:27.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他叫Xavier，是朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name's Xavier. He's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:28.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真幸运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's lucky guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:31.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想象一档关于地下舞蹈场景的节目\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Imagine a show about underground dance scenes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遍布全世界。而且Alexi会主持。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all over the world. And Alexi's gonna host it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，那就把它做出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一个人，我确实和她产生了真正的连接——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is one person with whom I've made a real connection --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}August。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}August.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:43.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见没？她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See? Her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直接把她剪掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just cut her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.31,0:00:45.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我搞到了一些素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I got some footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:49.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得这里有个特别有时代感的故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think there's a real zeitgeisty story here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上一季死了两个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two people died last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.65,0:00:53.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我的责任。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来找我是非常重要的一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coming to me was a very important step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:57.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想帮你弄清楚，这种——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to help you figure out where this --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:01:00.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种黑暗从何而来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this darkness comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:03.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上面这里也要收紧，不只是下面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need it tighter up here as well, not just down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:05.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，奎恩……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Quinn...
