Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:12.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不觉得我们应该先把提案卖出去吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you think we ought to actually sell our pitch first?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.41,0:01:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，杰伊，我觉得你把蛋忘在走廊了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Jay, I think you left your balls in the hall.
