Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:18.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，去看看那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, go take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Berto，你的手怎么不动？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Berto, why are your hands not moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是来干活的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're here to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.42,0:01:24.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，你这张Alexi的照片从哪来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, where did you get this shot of Alexi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:28.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我从他的公关团队那儿拿的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I got it from his PR people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让人想舔海报，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Makes you want to lick the poster, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，是啊，Alexi很棒，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, yeah, Alexi's great,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:35.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但Sissy Bounce是Xavier带来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but Sissy Bounce came from Xavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有他，我甚至都不知道那是什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't even know what it is without him.
