Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.73,0:01:39.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我男朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我——我是说，我一直以为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I -- I-I mean, I always just imagined
