Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，对你来说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，拜托，没有Alexi的明星效应，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, come on, without Alexi's star power,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:49.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只剩下你那种小众\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all we have is your niche
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.74,0:01:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}环游世界跳舞的催眠秀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}dance-around-the-world snooze-fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:53.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我们更有机会卖出\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, we'd have a better chance of selling
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:54.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《肛门漂白护照》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Passport to Anal Bleaching."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.95,0:01:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}——嘿，嘿，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别笑，你手里可拿着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not laugh when you have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:01:59.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尖针在我阴道周围，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sharp pins around my vagina, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.65,0:02:01.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，拿着这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, hold this.
