Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样我们就能把它剪进给加里的宣传片，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so we can drop it into a sizzle reel for Gary,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我们的提案无可辩驳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which will make our pitch undeniable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:11.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:12.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有个问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:15.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该说August有个问题。什么问题？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, August has a problem. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的丸子头。有人趁他睡觉时剪掉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His man-bun. Someone cut it off while he was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:22.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:28.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不算问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是电视节目的黄金素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is television gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:32.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:37.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:39.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天早上我去找过你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I went looking for you this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:42.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的住在那辆卡车里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you actually live in that truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:45.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}边界感。你听说过吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boundaries. You ever heard of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是担心你，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just concerned, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你昨晚说了很多心里话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You opened up a lot last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:49.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可能会让人心神不宁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That can be destabilizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，呃，那个，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, uh, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.27,0:02:53.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我说太多了。——不，你没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-maybe I said too much.   -No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:55.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我觉得我们应该继续合作——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is why I think we should keep working together --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:58.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样我们才能触及问题的核心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so that we can get to the core of the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:02:59.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不。我——我不是那个意思——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no. I-I-I -- that's not what --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想一直想这事，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't to keep thinking about this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想把事情搅起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to stir things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.65,0:03:04.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我脑子里不需要那些杂音。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't need that noise in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只需要专心工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just need to focus on my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我找到了塞蕾娜。是我把她带来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I found Serena. I brought her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我把她从那种公主屁事里救出来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the one that saved her from this princess shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:13.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我得为奎恩保持清醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I've got to keep my head together for Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是需要你考虑一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just need you to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我在这里做得挺好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I am actually doing a good job here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:18.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想继续做下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want to keep doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:19.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，片场需要你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you're needed on set.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:21.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:23.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，真的。这是我一直做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, really. This is what I've always done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:25.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样我才觉得一切在掌控中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is how I feel in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:26.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈，因为我还以为你说你感觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh, 'cause I thought you said you were feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:28.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失控、不诚实，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}out of control, dishonest,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.01,0:03:30.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有点害怕它会走向何方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and a little fearful of where it might lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你能别说了吗？  -这些白痴什么毛病？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Can you please stop?   -What's wrong with these idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.51,0:03:35.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得走了。不，这简直是笑话，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to go. No, it's an absolute joke, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你当然不会站出来承认，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, of course you won't stand up and admit it, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，大半夜的倒是又高大又勇敢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. Big and brave in the middle of the night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我站在这儿的时候就成了彻底的怂包……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but total chicken shit when I'm standing right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:43.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还清醒得很。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wide awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}消消气，参孙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Simmer down, Samson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.99,0:03:46.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一台机位拍奥古斯特\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One camera on August
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:48.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}另一台拍他那颗被砸烂的脑袋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and another camera on his mangled head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们真的觉得这样没问题？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you guys are seriously okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是啊，真没问题。  -塞雷娜在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah. Seriously.   -Where's Serena?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在化妆间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's in hair and make-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:54.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得该让她把卷发筒拆了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought she should have her rollers out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，你的故事直觉完全是反的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. Your story instincts are ass backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:59.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丹，现在就他妈给塞雷娜打电话。拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dan, fn Serena now. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。我觉得你是把我跟别人搞混了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. You know, I think you're mixing me up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟一个在这个台没有已制作试播集的人搞混了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with someone who doesn't have a produced pilot at this network.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是吗？叫什么名字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, really? What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:06.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《与加里的小三同行》？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Keeping Up With Gary's Sidepiece?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是他的小三。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am not his sidepiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他带我去度过假。-好，让我猜猜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He has taken me on vacation.   -Okay, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，很多私人周末，壁炉边的二人晚餐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, a lot of private weekends, dinner alone by the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊，你跟那男人一起公开露过面吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, have you ever been out in public with the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:17.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们谁干的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which one of you did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道今天的计划是让我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know the plan today was for me to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听这些人推销他们的梦想约会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}hear these guys pitch their dream dates,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我根本不在乎他们想要什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I don't give a damn what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，这种兄弟会小子那套太倒胃口了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, this frat-boy crap is a huge turn-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:31.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只要跟奥古斯特约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I only want a date with August.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.74,0:04:35.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的很抱歉。是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm really sorry. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:38.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以去试着说服她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can go try to flip her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用，我能搞定。你想让约会对象是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I can handle it. Who do you want the date to be with?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:42.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-阿列克谢。  -搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Alexi.   -Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:44.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。有人今早喝了咖啡啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Someone had their coffee this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.55,0:04:45.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你该把那股劲儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe you should try putting some of that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:47.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}往自己肚子里咽，麦迪逊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}down your throat, Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，罗宾，给你介绍下，这位是奎恩·金。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Robin, I'd like you to meet um, Quinn King.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:51.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是我的，呃，节目统筹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's my, uh, showrunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这位是罗宾·卡尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Robin Carr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:55.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她来自《国家页报》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's from The National Page.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:57.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她要写一篇报道，讲的是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gonna be writing a story about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这一季要探讨的一些重要议题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}some of the important issues we're gonna be tackling
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:01.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在《永恒》里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this season on "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:02.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，很高兴认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, well, it's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是好奇，你们为什么没播出\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just curious to know why you didn't air
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特给我看的上一集那段采访素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the interview footage Chet showed me from last episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.11,0:05:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别有时代感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's so zeitgeisty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:13.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是个非常出色而且……微妙的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is an excellent and...nuanced question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.45,0:05:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，能给我们三秒钟吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, could you just give us three seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-当然。  -谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sure.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:18.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想让我把约会对象换成别人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're trying to get me to pick someone else for the date,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:19.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是浪费时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我完全理解。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:23.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是怕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just afraid that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.69,0:05:25.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让他太容易得手了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're making it a little too easy for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先说我尖锐刻薄、不讨喜，现在又说我太容易。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First I'm strident, unappealing, and now I'm too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你自己说的。对这种男人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said it yourself. With these kind of guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:33.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得欲擒故纵，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you've got to play catch and release, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得先退一步才能把他们引过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got to pull back to draw them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:37.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我得玩这种把戏？又一次？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I'm supposed to play a game? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:38.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这整件事就是个游戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This whole thing is a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你比谁都清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.97,0:05:41.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让记者待在片场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Having a reporter on the set
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简直是最高警戒级别的危险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is like DEFCON-level dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。我的艾美奖公关需要曝光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. We need the publicity for my Emmy campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:49.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，这对节目也有好处——你该谢谢我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Plus, it's good for the sho-- You should be thanking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:50.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧，你懂的那点公关\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, what you know about publicity
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:52.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一只乳贴就装得下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could fit in a nipple cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:53.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有这东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.02,0:05:56.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，你那位《国家页报》的朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, your, uh, pal from The National Page
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是个货真价实的记者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is a real-ass reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:05:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而货真价实的记者只有一个目标\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And real-ass reporters have one goal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:01.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是挖黑料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that is to dig shit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是冲我来的，奎恩，好吗？让我来处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's here for me, Quinn, okay? Let me handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.93,0:06:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那咱们好好想想，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, let's just think about this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:08.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如，谁能让奥古斯特最嫉妒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, who would make August the most jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得是个有格调的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would have to be somebody sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:12.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如盖伊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:15.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道。他就只想聊吃的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. All he wants to do is talk about food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你得找个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you want someone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:20.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有灵魂、见多识广的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}soulful, well-traveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.85,0:06:23.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如阿列克谢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like Alexi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可以。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:28.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:29.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果我跟阿列克谢去约会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if I go on the date with Alexi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.92,0:06:31.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}之后我还是想跟奥古斯特相处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I still want time with August later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，这样——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, fine. How's this --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:35.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你选阿列克谢，我让奥古斯特在你房间等着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you pick Alexi, and I will have August waiting in your room
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:38.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你们点独处时间，不拍摄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for some alone time, off camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.57,0:06:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才乖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Atta girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:41.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:44.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她答应了。  -太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-On board.   -Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我们一直都这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, that is what we always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你带我去个公共场合。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to take me somewhere in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说帕尼斯餐厅出了新的品尝菜单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard Chez Panisse has a new tasting menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.95,0:06:55.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，我来订位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine, I'll make a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:59.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，那个，你的试播集有好消息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, um, I have good news about your pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，真的吗？什么消息？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, really? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:02.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……今晚告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll, uh, tell you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:04.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:07.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又怎么了？说吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now what? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:10.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我很担心瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I'm concerned about Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:12.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你是认真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒觉得她状态很好，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I actually think she's doing great,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以谢谢你顺路过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so thanks for swinging by.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:17.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她状态不好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:18.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚我们做了次很有成效的咨询，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had a real powerful session last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:20.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她跟我说了一些事——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and she told me some things that --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:21.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，她跟你说了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what did she tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.98,0:07:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是保密的。 - 最好是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's confidential.   -It better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是很高兴她终于肯开口了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just happy she's finally talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.91,0:07:26.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为据我所知，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause from what I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.58,0:07:27.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没多少能倾诉的人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she hasn't had a lot of people to confide in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们的工作才这么重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which is why our work is so vital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，抱歉。你的“工作”？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay sorry. Your "work"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你悠着点，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you slow your roll, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:35.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不是我们说好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was not part of our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是张安全网，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are a safety net, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:40.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是个行走的赞安诺发放机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are a walking Xanax dispenser.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:43.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是来深挖瑞秋的心理的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are not here to deep-dive into Rachel's psyche.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:45.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来帮我的病人的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here to help my patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:47.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难道你不想吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or don't you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:50.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，现在轮到给我做心理分析了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what, now I'm getting shrinked?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你想聊聊我那个坏妈妈吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, do you want to talk about my mean mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乐意之至。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:08:00.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里发生的那些事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The things that have happened here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你是怎么扛过来的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know how you're handling it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.65,0:08:05.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我现在就能告诉你，瑞秋绝不可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I can tell you right now, there is no way Rachel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:08.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这些全压下去、视而不见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}could just stuff it all down and ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:11.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她正走向崩溃，奎恩，我想阻止这一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's on a collision course, Quinn, that I am trying to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你要么帮我，要么做好准备。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So either help me or get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为迟早，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会爆发的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she's gonna blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:20.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:29.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我知道。对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我最近真的很忙。呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I -- I've just been really busy. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.89,0:08:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，其实奎恩她，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Actually, Quinn's, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.23,0:08:51.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别想把这个方案拿去给电视台。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}really excited to take the pitch to the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别，小泽，停下。只是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Xave, stop. It's j--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她显然觉得你特别棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Obviously she thinks you're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.87,0:08:57.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她想让你在节目里担大梁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She wants you to be a big part of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我也爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:11.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，阿列克谢……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Alexi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，呃，我就是想告诉你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, um, I-I just, uh, wanted to let you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我写了几句台词让你说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wrote up a couple things for you to say
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天你向塞雷娜讲你的梦幻约会时。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you pitch Serena your dream date today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，就是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, which is, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你想让我像个木偶一样背台词？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you making me learn lines like puppet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，就三句而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, dude, it's like three lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是太好了——事业跌到谷底了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is just great -- career hitting rock bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:31.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，呃，我——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, um, I --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我还有别的事要跟你说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's something else I need to talk to you about, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们接吻了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We kissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那又怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:39.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别惦记我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:42.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}*我能感觉到 你我会在雷耶斯海滩策马奔驰，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I can feel it You and I will gallop along the beach at Point Reyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许把马骑进海浪里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}maybe take our horses out into the surf
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:49.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你不介意弄得有点……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you don't mind getting just a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:51.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}湿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:52.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们出去兜风。你来开车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll go for a ride. You drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:55.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你、我，还有和我儿子卢在公园待一下午。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, me, and an afternoon in the park with my boy Lou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.73,0:09:57.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你我会花一整天和海豚一起航行，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and I will spend the day sailing with the dolphins
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:59.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}品着最上等的香槟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and sipping on the finest champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.27,0:10:02.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会给你看真正的魔法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll show you real magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不被打扰的专属时光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quality time with no distractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:07.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有你和我，还有……美丽的星空。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just you and me and...beautiful stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:10.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.84,0:10:13.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}八场梦幻约会你们都听了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have heard all eight dreamy dates,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:16.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞雷娜，有些真的很梦幻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena, some truly dreamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:18.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁来给格雷厄姆冲个凉降降温。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody hose Graham down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但只有一个能美梦成真。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But only one can become a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:23.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你们投入了这么多……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for putting so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}创意到你们的提案里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}creativity into your pitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，但对我来说只有一个梦幻约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, but there really is only one dream date for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:33.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿列克谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alexi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:39.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了！ - 哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes!   -Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.71,0:10:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，谢谢。好，这条过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, thank you. All right, and that is a cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:45.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太厉害了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are killing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:46.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。怎么——怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. What's -- What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞雷娜说她只想和我约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena said she only wanted a date with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你管得着吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.15,0:10:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还能待在这儿，算你走运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're lucky you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:54.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:00.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:03.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你看起来像是火烧眉毛了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause you kind of seem like you're on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:05.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，没事。我很好，真的很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, no. I'm good. I'm really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，那就好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我知道我昨天说了些话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I know I said some words yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.17,0:11:12.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把那些话放在心上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've taken those words to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再当那个扫把星了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to be the curse anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我从没说过你是扫把星。我——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I never said you were the curse. I --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:21.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那都不重要了，奎恩。我只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't even matter, Quinn. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.21,0:11:22.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我只想让你知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I just want you to know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.88,0:11:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完全投入了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I am, like, fully committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:25.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我脑子很清楚。我只是——我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My mind is clear. I just -- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.39,0:11:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是真的很想给你一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just really want to give you everything
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要的，来做出精彩的节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you need to make an amazing show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:33.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你知道吗？这样吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you know what? Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:36.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，如果你想给我我需要的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, if you want to give me what I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:38.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我要你去和Alexi约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then I'd like you to go on the date with Alexi.
