Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.45,0:16:25.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟公关说过，让我下线\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told my publicist taking me offline
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:26.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}六周简直是自杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for six weeks was suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:30.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只需要想办法制造点动静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just need to figure out a way to make some noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:31.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你知道你可以怎么做吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you know what you could do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.59,0:16:35.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以承认是你剪了奥古斯特的丸子头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could confess to cutting off August's man-bun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:36.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那很有动静。  -是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's noisy.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你嗨了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you high?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:39.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一，我才没干那种怂事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"A," I didn't do that puss move,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二，我要是承认了，所有人都会恨死我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"B," everybody would hate my ass if I claimed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞蕾娜肯定会砍了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena would definitely chop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:47.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么表情？你们——你们能跟我说话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that look? Can y-- Can y'all talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:51.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我们本来不打算告诉你，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, we weren't gonna tell you this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:54.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们听塞蕾娜说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we heard from Serena
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:56.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她今晚很可能还是会淘汰你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that she's probably cutting you tonight anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.25,0:16:57.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:17:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁将引领我们走向光明之路？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who will lead us into the pathway of light?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:02.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.82,0:17:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里有人知道真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody knows the truth here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:05.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敞开心扉，诚实面对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open your hearts and be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:07.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，扎克。来吧。有人吗？嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Zach. Come on. Anyone? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以的。承认吧。承认吧，伙计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can do this. Own it. Own it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是什么，胆小鬼吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you, a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:12.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，格雷厄姆，把那破棍子给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Graham, give me the damn stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:15.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这太荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们都有室友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So we all have roommates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.67,0:17:19.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，我们中至少有两个人知道昨晚谁溜出去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, at least two of us know who snuck out last night
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:22.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去，呃——去把奥吉先生的头发剪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to, uh -- to scalp Mr. Augie up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.14,0:17:23.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我也想知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:25.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.45,0:17:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我剪掉了他那个弱爆了的丸子头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I snipped off his weak-ass man-bun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:31.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:33.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦！  -而且我喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh!   -And I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:34.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-干得好。  -嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good one.   -Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-干得好，扎克。  -干得漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good one, Zach.   -Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，兄弟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good job, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.69,0:17:39.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿列克谢在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is Alexi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.36,0:17:41.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，你到底怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, what is going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我快吓疯了，行吗？我跟奎恩撒了谎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I am freaking out, okay? I lied to Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉她阿列克谢已经同意主持《舞蹈护照》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told her Alexi already agreed to host "Passport to Dance."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.86,0:17:47.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我根本还没跟他谈过这事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I haven't even talked to him about it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:48.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你开玩笑吧？杰，认真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you kidding? Jay, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她都在试定制西装了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's getting fitted for a custom suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.87,0:17:53.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。但我答应过泽维尔让他主持，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. But I promised Xavier he could host,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:17:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早在这一切之前就答应了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like, way before any of this, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.91,0:17:57.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不知道这个帝国计划对她意味着什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have no idea what this empire thing means to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:17:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋……什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:00.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，求你别说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, please don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.21,0:18:01.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能再卷进更多谎言里了，杰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't get wrapped up in any more dishonesty, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉。我真的不行。 -你知道，没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I am so sorry. I just can't.   -You know, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，反正你从没对奎恩隐瞒过什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you've never kept anything from Quinn anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？管好你自己的事，杰，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? Handle your shit, Jay, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在就去把阿列克谢搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get Alexi on board now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:13.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰·卡特，真是活久见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay Carter as I live and breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.23,0:18:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，我爱死你那漂亮脸蛋上的震惊表情了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O-M-G, I love that look of shock on your gorgeous face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:17.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这正是我想要的——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is exactly what I wanted --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:19.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把你这个井井有条又龟毛的家伙逮个正着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to catch your organized, fussy ass unawares.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:21.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。 -泽维，你在干……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come here.   -Xave, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:23.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这里干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:25.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来提案的，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here for the pitch, boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:28.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这叫“娘娘腔弹跳”。而我就是弹跳本跳，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Sissy Bounce. And I'm the bounce bounce, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，就是你。你就是那个弹跳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you are. You're the bounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.68,0:18:31.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。好了。别说了。这太疯狂了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. All right. Shut up. This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:33.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哇！  -耶！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Whoo!   -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.85,0:18:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扎克在撒谎。不是他。是我干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Zach is lying. It wasn't him. I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.85,0:18:37.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道——你知道是我干的。坐下，兄弟。真相是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know -- You know I did it. Sit down, man. Here's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:39.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我抓住他那小撮头发——不喜欢——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I grabbed his little nub -- didn't like it --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:40.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后就把它剪了，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I hacked it off, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐下！拜托，兄弟，我们都知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit down! Come on, man, we all know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:43.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫制片人出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get the producers out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.69,0:18:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有监控摄像头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are security cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:46.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，把摄像头关了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Cut these cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你明白我在说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know you know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有监控录像吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have the security footage?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.93,0:18:50.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吓到了吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-泽夫，这是瑞秋。  -你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Xave, this is Rachel.   -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.77,0:18:59.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘，你对我宝贝太重要了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Girl, you mean so much to my baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.81,0:19:01.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你对我也很重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so you mean so much to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:03.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿列克谢准备好了，漂亮的人们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alexi's ready, beautiful people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:06.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:10.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。是你。是他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. It's you. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:11.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰伊总爱夸你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay loves to talk you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:14.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看过你蹦来蹦去，蹦、蹦、蹦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have seen you bounce, bounce, bounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy moly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:19.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是阿列克谢·彼得罗夫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're Alexi Petrov.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:22.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你能当这个丝滑男人的幸运姐妹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you are super lucky sissy to this silky man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.73,0:19:24.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的灵魂在歌唱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her soul is singing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:47.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个动作都是一个音符。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}each movement a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.53,0:19:54.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是神性！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is divinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:57.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:03.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:06.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:14.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为重力之神举杯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Raise a glass to the God of the Gravity!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也为那些违抗重力的人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And those who defy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.75,0:20:23.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以他是装直男。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, he's playing straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:25.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，他是直男。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, he is straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他非常直。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's very straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.63,0:20:28.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在必须集中精力，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have got to focus on this right now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:33.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证，收工后我们可以再聊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can talk more after wrap, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:37.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}血肉之躯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Flesh and bone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有鲜血和勇气！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and blood and grit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全都弹射...\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All catapulting...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}...到空中！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.75,0:20:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:56.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们找到了录像\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have uncovered footage
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:58.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥古斯特午夜被剃头的录像。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from the midnight scalping of August.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:20:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真相时刻到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:01.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了扎克。为了比利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For Zach. For Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了美国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For America.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-放吧，格雷厄姆。播出来。  -好了，伙计们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do it, Graham. Play it.   -Okay, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:10.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真相时刻到了，伙计们。准备好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Moment of truth, boys. Get ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:11.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:15.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:17.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉过你们！我告诉过你们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you! I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:19.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，不，不，不。那上面该是我的脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no, no. That should be my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你抹掉了我的——你抹掉了我的脸，剪那玩意儿的时候！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wiped my -- you wiped my face, snipping that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.91,0:21:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们抹掉了我的—— -不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They wiped my -- -No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:24.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:27.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个比利，他有点疯疯癫癫的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That Billy, he's, like, a bit of a wackadoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你该去查查他脑子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you might need to go check under his hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:31.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。我感觉我完全清楚自己在对付什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I have a feeling I know exactly what I'm dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:35.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，这就是我们为什么配了心理医生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, this is why we have a psychologist on staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:37.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，事情有时会变得有点紧张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, things can get a bit intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你不想再有一个选手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, you don't want another contestant
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:41.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从屋顶跳下去吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}jumping off the roof, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:44.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:46.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，扎克真不简单，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Zach is really something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:49.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}心地善良，明星气场强大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Big heart, huge star power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:52.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实是我从我的试播集《#成年生活》里把他带过来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I actually brought him over from my pilot, "Hashtag Adulting."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:54.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你拍了试播集？你们一起做的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shot a pilot? Did you do it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.65,0:21:55.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。我自己做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no. I did it on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:57.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是啊，这位呢，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, this one here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她真是，呃，一飞冲天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she's on a real, uh, meteoric rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.79,0:22:02.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉她，麦迪逊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell her, Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:04.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是怎么拉上拉链爬上来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you zipped up the ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.09,0:22:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是把拉链拉开的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or was it un-zipped?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.39,0:22:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这两个我总搞混。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I always get those two confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.43,0:22:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.07,0:22:19.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.84,0:22:21.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿列克谢：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alexi:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你没事吧？  -国王回来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You okay?   -The king is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.51,0:22:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmmmmmmm mmmmm mmmmmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.88,0:22:27.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。来吧，我们走。我带你进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Come on, let's go. Let's get you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.45,0:22:28.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道——我知道我签了合同。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know -- I know I signed a contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我没签这个！ -嘿，走吧，阿列克谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But I didn't sign for this!   -Hey, let's go, Alexi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:33.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我带你——走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let's get you -- let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.49,0:22:35.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你劝我去赴那次约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for convincing me to go on that date.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.62,0:22:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我——我对刚才发生的事无话可说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have -- I have no words for what just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:40.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那真是——那真是疯了。天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was -- That was nuts. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.69,0:22:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，但我今晚还是想和奥古斯特独处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, but I still want my time with August tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.60,0:22:43.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我——我还是觉得他就是那个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I still think he's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:48.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}淘汰仪式后他会去你房间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's gonna be in your room after the elimination ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:49.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.82,0:23:04.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.88,0:23:06.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下，你是瑞秋·戈德堡吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, are you Rachel Goldberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.89,0:23:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我最讨厌的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My least favorite question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:10.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。我是《国家页报》的罗宾·卡尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. I'm Robin Carr from The National Page.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.02,0:23:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是奎恩的二把手，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're Quinn's number two, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.72,0:23:14.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。看哪天吧，可能是二把手，也可能排第十。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. It's 2 or 10 depending on the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.76,0:23:16.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很想跟你聊聊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would love to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，我们得...\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, we need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.03,0:23:20.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要走了。失陪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna go. Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.97,0:23:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，瑞秋不是她的二把手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, Rachel isn't her number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.77,0:23:28.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都是制片人，所以没有排名。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're all producers, so we aren't ranked.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.21,0:23:29.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}严格来说，这是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Technically that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.81,0:23:31.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，抱歉。我得接这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, excuse me. Got to get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:33.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，我女朋友。你好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, my girlfriend. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不不不不。那——那是控制灯光的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, no, no, no. That -- That -- That's for the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}另一个按钮是控制泡泡的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The other button is for the bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.19,0:23:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，给奎恩工作是什么感觉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what's it like working for Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.96,0:23:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听过很多关于她的事，不全是好话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've heard a lot about her, not all positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.16,0:23:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可能不该说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I probably shouldn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.99,0:23:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，现在我可好奇了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh, now I'm intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.56,0:23:51.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}传言说，除了瑞秋，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The word is, aside from Rachel,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:53.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女制片人在这一行都待不久。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}female producers don't really last around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.73,0:23:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想把事情摆正，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just need to make things right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.87,0:23:58.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为塞雷娜信任我，我不能一直骗她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause, like, Serena trusts me. I just can't keep lying to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:00.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和奥古斯特上过几次床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had sex with August a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.97,0:24:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-都过去了。放手吧。  -我知道。但她喜欢他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's over. Move on.   -I know. But she's into him
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.88,0:24:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他在约会时对她说的那些话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because of what he said to her on the date,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.21,0:24:05.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可他当时是在跟你说话。-等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-but he was talking to you.   -Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.94,0:24:08.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们在《永恒》上做的都不是真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what we're producing on "Everlasting" isn't real?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.88,0:24:13.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得奎恩受到年轻有野心的女性的威胁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think Quinn is threatened by younger, ambitious women.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.69,0:24:16.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。不，我完全看得出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. No, I can totally see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.52,0:24:18.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我是说，她仍然是个传奇人物，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I mean, she's still a phenomenon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.23,0:24:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.63,0:24:25.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她一团糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.06,0:24:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她一直在片场喝酒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's been drinking on set.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.17,0:24:29.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被电视台总裁抓到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The network president caught her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他私下告诉我的，当然，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he told me, privately, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.27,0:24:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她快要走人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that she's on her way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.27,0:24:36.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们就是不再信任她了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They just don't trust her anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你看起来是个真正的新起之秀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you seem like a real up-and-comer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.28,0:24:41.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。我觉得电视台也这么认为。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. I think the network thinks so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.58,0:24:43.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.58,0:24:45.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你知道我哪件事需要你帮忙吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you know what I could use your help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.58,0:24:47.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞雷娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.19,0:24:48.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们一整天都想把她和我隔开，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They've been trying to keep her away from me all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.92,0:24:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果我能跟她谈谈，我的报道就真的成了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it would seriously make my story if I could talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.99,0:24:55.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个我绝对能帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can definitely help you with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.19,0:24:58.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.63,0:25:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，我真的没法继续这样下去了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, I just can't keep doing this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:02.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我比你知道的还要努力，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, like, trying harder than you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.07,0:25:04.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我真的需要回到诚实的状态。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I really need to get back to being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.14,0:25:06.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你不需要。别这样了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you don't. Just stop it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.71,0:25:08.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没法做这份工作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You cannot do this job
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.61,0:25:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同时还保持基本的诚实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and be essentially honest at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.21,0:25:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果这让你崩溃还是怎样，我很抱歉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I am sorry if that is gonna make you explode or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.91,0:25:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你就是得放下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you just have to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.71,0:25:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，可是我做不到，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, I can't, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.85,0:25:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这儿几乎撑不住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, like, barely hanging on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.32,0:25:20.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的得做点什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really need to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.85,0:25:23.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.03,0:25:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。能给我们一点时间吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Can you give us a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.00,0:25:32.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-当然。  -谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sure.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.33,0:25:34.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞雷娜，这位是罗宾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Serena, this is Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.33,0:25:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗宾，塞雷娜。你们有五分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Robin, Serena. You have five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:37.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.90,0:25:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.27,0:25:41.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.14,0:25:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在为《国家页报》写一篇关于这个节目的报道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm writing a story on the show for The National Page.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.11,0:25:44.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你介意吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.64,0:25:46.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，不。当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, no. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.01,0:25:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我读了《闪谈》上那篇关于你的专访。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I read that profile of you in Flash Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.25,0:25:50.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是让人大开眼界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was really illuminating.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.98,0:25:52.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.38,0:25:56.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是好奇，一个硅谷的大人物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just wondering how a Silicon Valley baller
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.26,0:25:59.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么会让自己沦落成一个名副其实的落难少女\N{\rEN\blur0.8}let herself descend into a literal damsel in distress
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.29,0:26:01.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这么几周时间。-什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-in a matter of weeks.   -Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.93,0:26:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你想向女性传递什么信息？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, what message are you trying to send to women?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.40,0:26:08.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有传递任何信息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not sending any message.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.07,0:26:09.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想找个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just trying to find someone
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.30,0:26:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}共度余生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to spend the rest of my life with.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.64,0:26:15.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，听着，落难少女那事是个令人遗憾的小插曲，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look, the damsel thing was a regrettable blip,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.88,0:26:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果你看到我和阿列克谢的约会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but if you had seen my date with Alexi
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.68,0:26:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者我和奥古斯特之间的那种联系，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or the connection that I have with August,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.11,0:26:21.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就会知道我这里真的有选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you would know that I have real options here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.71,0:26:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。你听起来像被绑架的受害者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. You sound like a kidnapping victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.42,0:26:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得意识到他们每一步都在操纵你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to realize they are manipulating you at every step.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.12,0:26:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我比你想的掌控得多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm a lot more in control than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.09,0:26:32.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。塞雷娜，他们搞出这整出丸子头调查\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Serena, they've created this whole man-bun investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.09,0:26:33.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是为了让我有事可忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just to keep me occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.93,0:26:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁知道他们在这儿藏着什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who knows what they're hiding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.39,0:26:37.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天早上，我听到瑞秋说服阿列克谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This morning, I heard Rachel convincing Alexi
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.36,0:26:39.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假装喜欢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to pretend to be into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.10,0:26:40.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.43,0:26:42.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些制片人是怪物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These producers are monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.17,0:26:43.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要揭露他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm gonna expose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.70,0:26:46.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我是你，我谁也不信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I were you, I'd trust no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.27,0:26:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.98,0:26:53.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.81,0:26:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是不是一直在操纵那些男生喜欢我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you been producing the guys to like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.12,0:26:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁告诉你的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.75,0:26:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个记者。她看到你跟阿列克谢说话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That reporter. She saw you talking to Alexi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.92,0:27:02.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。你跟我说过你会一直对我坦诚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. You told me you'd always be straight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.29,0:27:05.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这正是我来参加这个节目的原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is why I came on this show in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.12,0:27:07.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以就告诉我到底怎么回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So just tell me what the hell's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:12.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.80,0:27:15.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，有时候我们确实得，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, like, sometimes we do have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.07,0:27:16.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，稍微推那些男生一把。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, like, push the guys a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.77,0:27:18.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}推他们喜欢我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.17,0:27:22.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，也许是阿列克谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, maybe Alexi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.07,0:27:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但奥古斯特不算。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But not August.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.85,0:27:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，你跟我说他很靠谱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on. You told me he was solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.41,0:27:31.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当着我面说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said it right to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.38,0:27:34.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让我像个傻瓜，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please don't make an ass out of me, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.09,0:27:36.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会受不了的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will not survive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.42,0:27:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你看，我是真的以为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look, I, like, legitimately thought
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.06,0:27:40.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥古斯特是个好人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that August was a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.49,0:27:42.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真是这么想的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.16,0:27:43.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后——然后我才发现——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then -- and then I found out --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.76,0:27:46.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你发现什么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? You found out what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.13,0:27:47.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥古斯特和奎恩睡过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}August slept with Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.73,0:27:49.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们之间有过那么一段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, they had this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.20,0:27:50.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她让我别告诉你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she asked me not to say anything to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.80,0:27:52.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这事快把我憋死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it has absolutely been killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:54.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉，塞蕾娜。你该知道真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so sorry, Serena. You deserve the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.84,0:27:57.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.11,0:28:03.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋告诉你我和奥古斯特睡过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel told you that I slept with August?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.82,0:28:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're vile.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.19,0:28:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个记者说的你全占了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are everything that reporter said you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.96,0:28:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等摄像机一开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Obviously I am gonna cut your boy toy
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.46,0:28:14.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上就把你的小情人踢走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the second the cameras roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.89,0:28:16.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了吧，别这样好不好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I wouldn't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.23,0:28:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把错全推给奥古斯特是不对的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a mistake to blame this all on August.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.20,0:28:20.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}省省吧，我不想听你那些自私的说辞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? I don't want to hear your self-serving spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.53,0:28:23.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我们都会犯错，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, we all make mistakes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.27,0:28:26.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我睡了奥古斯特，你睡了那个骑师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I slept with August and you slept with the jockey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:29.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.84,0:28:31.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都有错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.84,0:28:34.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，奥古斯特和我睡的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And besides, August didn't even really know you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.45,0:28:36.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根本不了解你。为什么不给他个机会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when he slept with me. Why not give him a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.48,0:28:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦。  -拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh.   -Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.22,0:28:40.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是这里最帅的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is the hottest guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.09,0:28:42.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以置信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.22,0:28:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一切根本就不是原本该有的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None of this is anything like it was supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.36,0:28:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.36,0:28:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从现在起，我只跟瑞秋打交道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From here on out, I'm only dealing with Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.36,0:28:50.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一点都不信任你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't trust you as far as I can punt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.96,0:28:53.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.07,0:29:00.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们是塑料的，但换了新的——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're plastic but they're changed --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.31,0:29:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好意思，我们聊完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, excuse us, okay? We are done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.34,0:29:02.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你开玩笑吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.84,0:29:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想写什么就写什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can write whatever you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.21,0:29:05.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包括我赶你出我们的片场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}including me kicking you off our set.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.94,0:29:07.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信麦迪逊觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I can't believe that Madison thought
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.38,0:29:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你和我们的女嘉宾说话没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that it was okay to let you talk to our Suitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.48,0:29:11.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么知道是麦迪逊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you know it was Madison?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.25,0:29:14.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在知道了。丹！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Until now. Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.85,0:29:16.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我很惊讶你对她这么狠。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, it's surprising to me that you're so rough on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.02,0:29:19.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为她就像年轻的你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because she's like a younger version of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.29,0:29:21.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连靠睡上位都学你的样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}even following your example of sleeping your way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.30,0:29:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不了解我，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.43,0:29:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这节目里爬上来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I rose up on this show
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.17,0:29:29.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是靠在幕后拼了那么多年命，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}after busting my ass for years in the shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.00,0:29:31.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到我终于拿到了应得的功劳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until I finally got the credit I deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.44,0:29:34.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有意思，你把自己包装成\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is so interesting that you position yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.01,0:29:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女性主义英雄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as this feminist hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.91,0:29:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我从没这么说过。  -很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I never said that.   -Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.21,0:29:41.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我觉得真相是你恨你自己，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I think what's really happening is you hate yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.61,0:29:43.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你才把毕生精力都用来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which is why you've made it your life's work
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.05,0:29:43.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毁掉别的女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to destroy other women.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.85,0:29:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是真正的故事，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the real story here, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.95,0:29:47.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正的故事……就是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The real story... is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.39,0:29:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.96,0:29:51.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的事实核查员很快会联系你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My fact checker will be getting in touch soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.92,0:29:55.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.10,0:29:58.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信那个女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.70,0:30:00.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟塞蕾娜谈了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you talk to Serena?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.50,0:30:02.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谈了。  -然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes.   -And?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.60,0:30:04.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后效果特别好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And worked like a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.90,0:30:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她恨我，爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She loathes me and loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.17,0:30:11.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你继续当她的引导人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, we are back on with you as her guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.51,0:30:14.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？感觉好点了吗？够坦诚了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? Feel better? Super honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.15,0:30:15.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正我感觉好多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.88,0:30:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我们都该感觉好点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, we all should feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.15,0:30:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了塞蕾娜。不过，管他呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Except Serena. But, you know, kumbaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.38,0:30:21.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我该感觉好点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I should feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.12,0:30:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来肯定以为会好点，但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I definitely thought I would, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.16,0:30:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.46,0:30:29.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.06,0:30:30.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直在跟西蒙医生谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been talking to Dr. Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.96,0:30:33.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我听说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.93,0:30:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我今天早上差点做了件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I almost did something this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.53,0:30:37.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.60,0:30:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了，别问了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.44,0:30:41.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.14,0:30:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在不是时候。好多人盯着我们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not the time. We have a lot of eyes on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.38,0:30:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能失控，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you can't be going off the rails
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.11,0:30:47.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不能跟西蒙医生搞什么深度治疗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or doing a deep out with Dr. Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.25,0:30:48.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我没在干那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, that's not what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.02,0:30:51.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.02,0:30:54.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是在，修复我自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, like, fixing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.12,0:30:56.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那到底是什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.26,0:30:57.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的意思是，好好做节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, just produce the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.69,0:31:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别杀人，你就没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}don't kill anybody, and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.19,0:31:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不想我好起来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you want me to get better?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.63,0:31:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.59,0:31:04.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但不是现在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But just not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.46,0:31:06.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你能等这季结束再说吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, can you just wait till the season's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.97,0:31:10.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我做不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.24,0:31:15.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再等了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not waiting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.68,0:31:26.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，阿列克谢，别——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Alexi, d--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.95,0:31:28.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.19,0:31:32.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从哪儿弄来的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you get...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.29,0:31:34.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟谢尔盖干的就是这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this what you were doing with Sergei?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.46,0:31:36.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才让我觉得自己活着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is what makes me feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.56,0:31:38.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它让我成为娜塔莉亚想要的那种男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It makes me be the man Natalia wants me to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.66,0:31:40.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰，阿列克谢在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay, where's Alexi?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.33,0:31:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}淘汰仪式需要他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need him for the Elimination Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.64,0:31:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我收拾好，穿好衣服。马上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to get your shit together and get dressed. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.01,0:31:54.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正如伟大的陀思妥耶夫斯基所说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As the great Dostoyevksy might've said,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.58,0:31:57.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有罪必有罚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there can be no crime without punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.28,0:32:00.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以现在该由塞雷娜来伸张正义了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so it is time for Serena to mete out justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.52,0:32:02.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一位选手必须被处决。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One contestant must be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，是从节目里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From the show, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.36,0:32:06.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其余的人将获得自由。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the rest will get their freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.32,0:32:10.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一台Coif Chopper DX便携理发系统。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a Coif Chopper DX portable hair-cutting system.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.66,0:32:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为既然能得到吸发器\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because why settle for a hair cut
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}何必只满足于剪发呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you can get a hair vacuum?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.73,0:32:17.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞雷娜，你选谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena, who are you choices?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.17,0:32:20.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欧文，你愿意留下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Owen, will you stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.71,0:32:23.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}盖伊，你愿意留下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guy, will you please stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.11,0:32:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沃伦，你愿意留下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Warren, will you please stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.38,0:32:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.65,0:32:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿列克谢，你愿意留下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alexi, will you please stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.15,0:32:32.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。开玩笑的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.72,0:32:34.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.02,0:32:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢。噢。噢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Oh. Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.66,0:32:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}终于有人有点料了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Finally somebody with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.59,0:32:40.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贾斯珀，你愿意留下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jasper, will you please stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.53,0:32:42.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等她发现你打的赌再说吧，混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait till she finds out about your bet, dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.74,0:32:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥古斯特，你愿意留下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}August, will you please stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.07,0:32:53.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.54,0:32:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.58,0:32:59.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, where's Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.64,0:33:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从早上就没见过她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't seen her since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.61,0:33:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.45,0:33:06.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}待会儿房间见？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you in the room later?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.68,0:33:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想都别想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.49,0:33:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在只剩下两位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now just two remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.29,0:33:14.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但只有一位能获得缓刑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But only one can receive a stay of execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.83,0:33:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}经历了今天这一切之后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After everything that's happened today,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.83,0:33:19.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以肯定地说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can safely say
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.83,0:33:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我最看重的品质\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the most important quality that I am looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.43,0:33:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是诚实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.34,0:33:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少你们中有一个有胆量露出真面目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least one of you had the guts to show your true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.77,0:33:29.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扎克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Zach.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.81,0:33:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贱人，什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bitch, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.51,0:33:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.11,0:33:34.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.58,0:33:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，这不对。给我找个制片人来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, this isn't right. Get me a producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.65,0:33:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。好，他说是他做的，可根本不是他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. Okay, he's saying he did it which he did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.15,0:33:41.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算是他做的，你为什么淘汰的不是他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And even if he did, why are you not cutting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.49,0:33:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我终于要淘汰你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I'm finally cutting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.16,0:33:44.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.32,0:33:45.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—噢！  -—真不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh!   -That's very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.29,0:33:46.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会吧，你真干了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.86,0:33:48.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.10,0:33:52.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会想你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.84,0:34:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，嘿，这一条过了，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, hey, and that's a cut, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.37,0:34:03.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会想念比利，但不想念他的牙签。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I will miss Billy but not his toothpicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.24,0:34:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，杰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, um, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.11,0:34:08.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得跟你说。我看了阿列克谢那段素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to tell you. I saw the footage with Alexi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.55,0:34:10.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你用了什么办法让他保持状态，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what you were doing to keep him on his stride,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.82,0:34:12.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但继续保持。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but keep it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.28,0:34:14.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为那就是我们需要的阿列克谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because that is the Alexi we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.29,0:34:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，好，好。我理解。没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, yeah, yeah. I understand. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.76,0:34:22.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我晚点再见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can just meet you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.66,0:34:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.27,0:34:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chez Panisse？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chez Panisse?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.50,0:34:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他得加班。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He had to work late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.24,0:34:36.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他打算点外卖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's just gonna order in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.54,0:34:38.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我被开除了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.78,0:34:40.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我就是干这个的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause that's what I do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.45,0:34:43.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毁掉别的女人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Destroy other women?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.59,0:34:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.93,0:34:56.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是不明白，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.90,0:35:00.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对你严厉是因为我想帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm hard on you because I'm trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.17,0:35:02.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为瑞秋那么擅长她的工作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think Rachel got so good at her job
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.67,0:35:04.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是因为我对她好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I was nice to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.80,0:35:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该找一份\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should be looking for a career
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.91,0:35:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能长久、有意义的职业。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that lasts and means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.88,0:35:13.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢一点。好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slow down. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.24,0:35:15.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在想办法靠加里插队。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're trying to cut to the front of the line with Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.81,0:35:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我向你保证，那不会有好结果。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I promise you, that is not going to end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.75,0:35:25.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人看到瑞秋了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does anybody have eyes on Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.33,0:35:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.40,0:35:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是瑞秋·戈德堡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Rachel Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.77,0:35:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，我认识你吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:41.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我母亲是奥莉芙·戈德堡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My mother is Olive Goldberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.84,0:35:45.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她以前是你的心理医生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was your therapist?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.54,0:35:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.99,0:35:57.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我被蒙蔽了双眼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I was blinded
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.52,0:35:59.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—你骗了我。  -—什么？不，我没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You lied to me.   -What? No, I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.26,0:36:00.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说过食物会很糟糕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said the food would be terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.63,0:36:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但景色会很美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but the view would be magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.79,0:36:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这景色你无可挑剔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You cannot question this view.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.59,0:36:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说鸡翅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I meant the wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.23,0:36:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好吃了。是拉差辣酱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're amazing. Sriracha?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.33,0:36:08.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酷，好啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cool. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.67,0:36:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你吃不吃辣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wasn't sure if you like spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.27,0:36:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，你觉得这就算辣啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aw, you think these are spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.87,0:36:13.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哎呀。  -嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Aww.   -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.51,0:36:15.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你总是这么开心吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You always this happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.97,0:36:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why wouldn't I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.28,0:36:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在电视行业工作，简直是梦想成真。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Working in TV's been a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.41,0:36:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我记得我以前也觉得来上班很有意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember when I used to think coming to work was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.72,0:36:26.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 吸气，灯光渐暗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Breathe in, the lights fade
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.02,0:36:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 是药物的作用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* It's the drugs
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.75,0:36:30.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得这挺有意思的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think this is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.39,0:36:36.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 直到我再次爱上你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Until I love you once again
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.70,0:36:40.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:42.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。不，也没那么有意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Nah, it's not that fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.97,0:36:50.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 挑战重力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Defy gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.88,0:36:55.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你在想淹死自己，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're thinking about drowning yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.05,0:36:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那件外套看起来浮力可真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that coat looks awfully buoyant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.68,0:37:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}介意我陪你吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mind if I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.42,0:37:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.56,0:37:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方也让我头晕目眩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This place is making my head spin, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.66,0:37:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本想让你喝一口，但，呃，我每一滴都得留着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd offer you a sip, but, um, I'm gonna need every drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.00,0:37:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以理解。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.00,0:37:15.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 挑战\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Defy
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.77,0:37:18.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.64,0:37:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我问你个事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.74,0:37:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我们在现实世界遇见，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we met in the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.48,0:37:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你走进Vertigo，而我正好在那儿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you walked into Vertigo and I was there...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.72,0:37:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.92,0:37:35.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会要你的电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd get your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.89,0:37:38.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我绝对不会让你走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I definitely wouldn't let you leave
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.62,0:37:41.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非我确定那是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before I made sure that it was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.96,0:37:43.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我会打电话给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then I'd call you up
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.76,0:37:47.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后，呃，在你到家之前就约你出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'd, um, ask you out before you'd even got home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.47,0:37:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 挑战重力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Defy gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.07,0:37:54.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 重力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.77,0:37:57.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，我觉得这样好多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, actually, I think this is a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.94,0:37:59.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那里总是太吵了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's always so noisy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.61,0:38:01.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个——那个蛋糕怎么样？看起来很好吃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How -- How's that torte? That looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.48,0:38:03.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，我的试播集有什么好消息？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what's the exciting news about my pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.35,0:38:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你终于看了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you finally watch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.55,0:38:06.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你知道，我本来想看的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, you know, I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.02,0:38:08.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，这一周简直糟透了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's been a week from hell, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.72,0:38:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但好消息是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the good news is
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.79,0:38:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的助理莱尼看了，他很喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lenny, my assistant, watched it, and he loves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.99,0:38:18.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，其实我头疼得厉害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, actually, my head is pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.46,0:38:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有阿司匹林吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have any aspirin?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.70,0:38:21.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.67,0:38:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有。在，呃，走廊尽头的厨房里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. In the, uh, kitchen down the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.07,0:38:27.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.14,0:38:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去拿。怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll get it. How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.67,0:38:30.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.54,0:38:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.68,0:38:32.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真好吃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.88,0:38:34.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我留点那个蛋糕，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Save me some of that torte, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.81,0:38:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.96,0:38:49.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.77,0:38:58.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，是这么回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.81,0:39:03.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和奎恩在推销一档叫《舞蹈护照》的节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm pitching a show with Quinn called "Passport to Dance,"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.44,0:39:05.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你会是里面的明星。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're gonna be the star of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.54,0:39:07.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你凭什么觉得我会答应？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What makes you think I'd do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.14,0:39:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.82,0:39:13.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我觉得我需要一个了结。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I think I just need some closure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.58,0:39:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，关于你对我做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, about what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.85,0:39:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.89,0:39:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我们做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.59,0:39:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.06,0:39:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，是你对我做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, like, what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.90,0:39:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.03,0:39:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都知道你母亲沉迷一些怪事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We both know that your mother was into some weird stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.03,0:39:29.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞什么“实验性”夫妻治疗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with that "experimental" couples therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.00,0:39:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你进来看到我们了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You came in and saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.64,0:39:34.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在偷看。-不——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You were watching.   -N--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.64,0:39:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟着我进了卧室。-没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You followed me into my bedroom. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.71,0:39:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去了洗手间，你就在走廊里等着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I went to the bathroom and you were waiting in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.91,0:39:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.51,0:39:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我问你好不好奇。你说是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I asked you if you were curious. You said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.15,0:39:46.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我才12岁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.68,0:39:48.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.49,0:39:50.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不——不可能。你说你17岁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}N-- That's not possible. You said you were 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.02,0:39:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我撒谎了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.59,0:39:55.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.90,0:39:59.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我说愿意，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I say yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.66,0:40:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会再给我多带点吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you'll bring me more?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.67,0:40:06.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.47,0:40:09.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.68,0:40:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说你抱歉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.05,0:40:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这应该让我好受点，还是让我原谅你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that supposed to make me feel better or forgive you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.12,0:40:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我——你知道，我做不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I -- you know, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.09,0:40:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底有没有想过你对我做了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ever even think about what you did to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.99,0:40:30.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每次照镜子都会想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every time I look in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.26,0:40:33.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲那晚来过——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father ca that night --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.70,0:40:35.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.83,0:40:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲根本不知道发生了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father never even knew about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.84,0:40:39.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他当然知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.70,0:40:41.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他那晚来了，把我打了个半死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He came that night, and he beat the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.14,0:40:42.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.61,0:40:46.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这根本不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's just not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.08,0:40:48.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能。因为我父亲要是知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not. Because if my father knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.05,0:40:49.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他肯定会跟我说点什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he would've said something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.95,0:40:54.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我父亲知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If my father knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.95,0:40:57.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.96,0:41:01.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，我很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.89,0:41:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.07,0:41:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.54,0:41:20.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你吓死我了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're scaring the hell out of me, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.18,0:41:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.91,0:41:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.18,0:41:54.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
